<title>USA: Weirton Steel says outage to hurt Q4.</title>
<headline>Weirton Steel says outage to hurt Q4.</headline>
<dateline>WEIRTON, W.Va. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weirton Steel Corp said Wednesday that an upcoming blast furnace outage is expected to hurt its operating performance in the fourth quarter and the first quarter of the next year.</p>
<p>Nevertheless, the company said its order rates continue to be strong.</p>
<p>The company did not offer an estimate on the effect of the blast furnace outage.</p>
</text>
